{"symbol":"NBL","yahoo":"NBL.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Naapbooks Limited","sector":"Technology","industry":"Information Technology Services","website":"https://www.naapbooks.com","about":"Naapbooks Limited develops and provides information technology solutions to corporates in India. The company designs, develops, codes, programs, operates, installs, analyzes, maintains, converts, ports, and debugs software products; implements ERP services; and develops fintech, blockchain, Internet of Things (IoT), cybersecurity, mobile, web, and embedded applications, as well as provides software and cloud consulting services. It also offers eAuction, an online auction solution; EZEO, a supply chain management system; VizMan, a visitor management SaaS platform; eNotary platform, a notarization process through blockchain and AI technologies; Restaurant SaaS for workflow automation for hospitality operations; e-Voting, an online voting platform; iPing, an enterprise communication system; FlowShift, an enterprise data validation and remediation and end-to-end data-migration suite; and InsiderQ, a structured digital database software to manage and log unpublished price sensitive information, as well as ACT, a task management system. The company serves food and beverages, retail, textiles, startups, engineering, BFSI, professional services, energy, information technology, and real estate sectors. Naapbooks Limited was incorporated in 2017 and is headquartered in Ahmedabad, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:43:19+00:00","quote":{"price":151.2,"prevClose":144.0,"marketCap":179.07,"high52":193.95,"low52":70.0,"pe":19.74,"bookValue":40.93,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":20.68,"shares":1.1843,"insiders":70.46,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2021-09-15","2021-09-16","2021-09-17","2021-09-20","2021-09-21","2021-09-22","2021-09-23","2021-09-24","2021-09-27","2021-09-28","2021-09-29","2021-09-30","2021-10-01","2021-10-04","2021-10-05","2021-10-06","2021-10-07","2021-10-08","2021-10-11